window.RP_SESSION={"id":"S-0c31916689ab","messages":[{"id":"RP-III-0184229","time":"2026-09-20T02:24:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ... ... 엣취! \"\n\n불그스래 물든 코 끝을 매만졌다. 맹한 표정으로 창가를 바라보았다.","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184230","time":"2026-09-20T02:25:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"어둑한 날씨가 드리운 창가 너머로 드문드문 불빛이 가라앉은 풍경.\n시선을 잠시 창 밖에 두었다가. 떠올린 듯 책상에서 무언가를 꺼내들었다.","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184231","time":"2026-09-20T02:25:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!운명","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184232","time":"2026-09-20T02:25:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"운명 : 3 = 3\n결과 : 비극, 이 또한 당신의 운명입니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-III-0184233","time":"2026-09-20T02:25:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"그것은 바로바로~","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184234","time":"2026-09-20T02:26:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" .. 없어?? \"","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184235","time":"2026-09-20T02:27:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"책상 서랍을 끝까지 열어서 안쪽을 뒤적거려보지만 보이질 않았다. \n\n\" 어, 어라. 어라... \"\n\n되뇌이듯 중얼거리며 책상서랍을 도로 넣어두고. 생각에 잠겼다.","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184236","time":"2026-09-20T02:28:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!지력","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184237","time":"2026-09-20T02:28:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!지능","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184238","time":"2026-09-20T02:28:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'에일린'의 지능 판정 :\n[7] + [1] = [8]\n결과 : 훌륭한 성공, 운명이 당신을 이끕니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-III-0184239","time":"2026-09-20T02:29:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ...윗층에 두고 왔나? \"\n\n의자를 밀어 일어난 뒤, 계단을 오를 무렵이었다.","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184240","time":"2026-09-20T02:30:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ... 응? \"\n\n인기척이 느껴져 자연스럽게 발을 멈추고 기둥 뒤에 숨었다. 얼굴만 살짝 내밀어서 무슨 일인고 살펴보니.","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184241","time":"2026-09-20T02:31:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"부길드장... 스텔라님의 방에 에스텔님이 들어가는게 아닌가?","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184242","time":"2026-09-20T02:31:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ... ... 어라, 뭔가 들으면 안될지도. \"","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184243","time":"2026-09-20T02:32:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"왜인지 그런 느낌이 들어서 다시 책상으로 돌아와 앉았다. 물건은 조금 이따가 찾아도 괜찮은 일이니까.","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184244","time":"2026-09-20T02:32:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ... ... \"\n\n그렇게 일과를 마무리 할 때 까지 다시 찾으러 갈 생각은 못했고.","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184245","time":"2026-09-20T02:32:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!지능","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184246","time":"2026-09-20T02:32:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'에일린'의 지능 판정 :\n[7] + [1] = [8]\n결과 : 훌륭한 성공, 운명이 당신을 이끕니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-III-0184247","time":"2026-09-20T02:33:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\" ... \"\n\n흘긋, 천장을 올려다보며 얼룩이나 세고 있다가. 결국 뭘 찾으려고 했는지도 잊고 잠에 들었다고.","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184248","time":"2026-09-20T02:33:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"에일린","profile":"에일린","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-fin","characters":["P-282078b1a2ea"]},{"id":"RP-III-0184249","time":"2026-09-20T02:33:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"...good for you.","characters":[]}]};
